{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>KreatureKind is an approachable and wholesome Card Battler/Deck Builder, where you debate monsters to save magic!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Build your team from the seven playable characters (pick Luca if you like a sad emo boy, Riley for killer dance moves). </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each has their own strengths and weaknesses, which need to be balanced to win debates!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1428090/extras/GifFrame_7.gif?t=1746294023\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Easy to learn, hard to master</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Even if you're new to this kind of game, you'll figure it out. <br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Played every card battler on the market? These monsters will still give you a run for your money!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1428090/extras/GifFrame_2.gif?t=1746294023\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Use your cards to debate monsters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you don't convince them to join your cause, magic will disappear forever. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No pressure! :3 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1428090/extras/GifFrame_1.gif?t=1746294023\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Discover, unlock, upgrade</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game features seven playable characters with different focuses, numerous plushies that make them better in discussions, and a whole bunch of cards to build your strategies around. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1428090/extras/GifFrame_3.gif?t=1746294023\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Go on campaign</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play though procedurally generated maps and win over each magic faction to your cause.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you're unsuccessful, you have to start over - but only the current map! We're nice like that.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1428090/extras/GifFrame_4.gif?t=1746294023\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>What to expect</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udde0 <strong>Wholesome Card-Based &quot;Debate Battles&quot;</strong> \u2013 Debate monsters instead of defeating them in combat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfb4 <strong>Strategic Deckbuilding\u00a0</strong>\u2013\u00a0Build and balance your decks carefully to handle the increasingly more challenging encounters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f <strong>Adventure Across a Vibrant World</strong> \u2013 Explore villages, forests, and cities filled with troubled creatures and charming NPCs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfad <strong>Narrative-Driven Campaign</strong> \u2013 A heartfelt story about community, empathy, and fighting for a better future in an increasingly less colorful world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfa8 <strong>Colorful, Expressive Art</strong> \u2013 Hand-drawn 2D art with expressive animation and a distinct, charming aesthetic.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfb6 <strong>Lofi Soundtrack</strong> \u2013 The cozy playlist matches the emotional tone of your journey.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udde9 <strong>Forgiving Roguelite Progression</strong> \u2013 Keep your unlocks if you fail an encounter, while restarting the current map.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfae <strong>Perfect for Single Players</strong> \u2013 Designed for solo storytelling and strategic exploration.</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Magic is Saved!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1428090/78dad41591f05882b6515e3b09981b4830f9ef9c.jpg"},{"name":"All Cards in Deck","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1428090/c2ec174135b3ed15eff66c0b8a201d47ba1bf32e.jpg"},{"name":"Powerhouse","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1428090/68f91b92a34a8a257d963707c6526a802e81987f.jpg"},{"name":"The Full Set","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1428090/a1ddc4df11a53f25794ca51018dc59f3d8a0b123.jpg"},{"name":"Debate Champion","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1428090/782e1a5f445628f707ac096899f7088a1bf7a19b.jpg"},{"name":"Dynamic Duo","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1428090/75e9584e50b296bb518e5e01596607e9a34a9f87.jpg"},{"name":"Upping the Game","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1428090/0eac4623998eed525e28018dcf7b4dc28f4de137.jpg"},{"name":"Um, Actually...","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1428090/276a2cc4a28ca3a06e70256e56e1eeaf2c8c31fb.jpg"},{"name":"Still Committed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1428090/8f7a8c34e128fb4e2b658ba50fac9e1543d7a795.jpg"},{"name":"Zealots","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1428090/74f1a1001395b2c1a0b67610ddda098a022f8d86.jpg"}],"total":32},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1428090?t=1746294023","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1428090/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1746294023","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/st