ul world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfa8 <strong>Colorful, Expressive Art</strong> \u2013 Hand-drawn 2D art with expressive animation and a distinct, charming aesthetic.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfb6 <strong>Lofi Soundtrack</strong> \u2013 The cozy playlist matches the emotional tone of your journey.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udde9 <strong>Forgiving Roguelite Progression</strong> \u2013 Keep your unlocks if you fail an encounter, while restarting the current map.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfae <strong>Perfect for Single Players</strong> \u2013 Designed for solo storytelling and strategic exploration.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Valiant Game Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1428090/f2630936dd73782ed4fb37549f70aa40396bd3f0/header.jpg?t=1746294023","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257126668,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257126668/movie480.mp4?t=1744797790","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257126668/movie_max.mp4?t=1744797790"},"name":"Release Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257126668/5f1d466a72dabc40ab38c457fcc56c91cc0e1610/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1744797790","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257126668/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1744797790","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257126668/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1744797790"}}],"name":"KreatureKind","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","subs":[{"can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"option_description":"","option_text":"KreatureKind - <span class=\"dis